+# Results provenance evidence (P10 / WSmart-Route issue 75)
+
+This ledger accompanies the paper's Implementation Provenance subsection.
+It documents read-only checks of archived results, not corrected experimental
+outcomes. No simulator runs were performed for P10. Original run records on
+another machine are pending recovery; rerun scope remains deferred (owner Q8).
+
+Paper edit base: `5ae3dd7` in the paper repository.
+Code inspected for this pass: WSmart-Route `19e099415e5c15dec79a788eb34e92f699071429`.
+Paths below refer to the **WSmart-Route project root**, except this ledger's
+path and the paper's `Tables/` files. Files under `.agent/cache/` are local
+review artifacts; they are not asserted to be publicly hosted or a complete
+historical execution manifest. Recovering that manifest remains open.
+
